insert into public.premium_prompts (title, description, category, poster_url, duration, prompt_text)
values
('Royal Black & Gold Logo Reveal','A luxury brand intro with gold particles, dramatic lighting and a powerful final reveal.','ROYAL INTRO','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519608487953-e999c86e7455?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80','8–10 sec • 9:16','Create a premium 9:16 vertical cinematic logo reveal, 8–10 seconds. Begin in deep black darkness. Golden dust particles slowly swirl through cinematic smoke. A warm gold light sweeps across the scene as a powerful shockwave of light expands outward. Reveal my uploaded logo exactly as provided: do not redraw, replace, crop, or alter its letters or shape. Add realistic metallic gold reflections, subtle sparks, dramatic shadows, smooth camera push-in, elegant black-and-gold color grading, crisp details, professional sound-design feel. End with the original logo centered and clearly visible. No extra text, no watermark, no logo distortion.'),
('Golden-Hour Portrait Reel','Warm sunset light, natural movement and a polished cinematic portrait.','CINEMATIC PORTRAIT','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80','8 sec • 9:16','Create an 8-second photorealistic vertical 9:16 cinematic portrait video using my uploaded reference photo. Preserve the person''s identity and facial features accurately; do not change the face. Golden-hour sunlight, gentle breeze moving hair and clothing naturally, soft background bokeh, realistic skin texture, subtle natural expression, slow smooth camera orbit, shallow depth of field, premium film color grading, balanced highlights, stable anatomy and hands. Keep the subject recognizable in every frame. No face morphing, no flicker, no extra fingers, no text, no watermark. High-detail cinematic quality.'),
('Luxury Car Night Cinematic','Glossy reflections, city lights and a smooth automotive tracking shot.','SUPERCAR FILM','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503376780353-7e6692767b70?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80','8 sec • 9:16','Generate an 8-second vertical 9:16 luxury automotive commercial featuring an elegant premium sports car on a rain-polished city street at night. Start with a close-up of the headlight, then smoothly track along the bodywork as neon city lights reflect across the paint. Fine mist in the air, realistic wet-road reflections, controlled cinematic lens flare, low-angle camera movement, deep blacks, refined gold highlights, photorealistic materials, smooth motion and consistent car design. Keep wheels and body geometry stable. No brand logos, no text, no watermark, no sudden cuts.'),
('Epic Sunset Travel Reel','A dreamy travel scene with sweeping scenery and smooth camera motion.','TRAVEL REEL','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ee3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80','8 sec • 9:16','Create an 8-second vertical 9:16 cinematic travel video of a lone traveler standing on a scenic ridge at sunset. Open with a wide landscape shot, then perform a smooth slow camera push forward. Golden sun rays pass through dramatic clouds, grass moves gently in the wind, atmospheric haze adds depth, natural colors, realistic terrain, subtle lens flare and premium travel-film grading. Maintain believable scale and stable scenery throughout. No fast jitter, no warped landscape, no text, no watermark. Compose the subject clearly for a mobile screen.'),
('Magical Floating Kingdom','An original fantasy world reveal with mountains, clouds and glowing architecture.','FANTASY WORLD','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470770841072-f978cf4d019e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80','10 sec • 9:16','Create a 10-second original fantasy cinematic in vertical 9:16. A breathtaking floating kingdom emerges above enormous mist-covered mountains. Glowing waterfalls fall into the clouds, tiny golden lights shimmer across elegant ancient towers, birds glide in the distance, and morning sunlight breaks through the clouds. Begin with a wide establishing view, then move the camera forward smoothly to reveal intricate architecture. Epic scale, atmospheric depth, realistic cloud motion, beautiful gold-and-blue palette, consistent structures, polished VFX quality. No existing movie characters, no text, no watermark.'),
('Funny 3D Cartoon Street','A colorful original animated comedy moment in a lively Indian market.','3D ANIMATION','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550745165-9bc0b252726f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80','8 sec • 9:16','Create an 8-second vertical 9:16 original 3D cartoon comedy scene in a lively Indian street market. Two original funny friends react to a runaway stack of colorful snack boxes, then exchange surprised expressions and laugh. Add chai stalls, an auto-rickshaw passing in the background, festive shop colors and lively but readable action. Expressive faces, appealing stylized 3D animation, smooth camera pan, warm daylight, detailed environment, consistent character designs and clean motion. Use original characters only; do not imitate existing copyrighted cartoon characters. No subtitles, no watermark, no distorted faces or limbs.'),
('Aura Farming Korean AI Video — Classroom Entry','A confident slow-motion classroom entrance inspired by Korean drama cinematography.','NEW VIRAL','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580582932707-520aed937b7b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80','8 sec • 9:16','Aura farming Korean drama entry scene. Reference image boy starts sitting on desk, then slowly stands up with full attitude, camera does slow motion push-in, wind blowing hair slightly, other boys in background also stand with aura, confident walk, cinematic 24fps, slow-mo 0.5x, background green classroom, K-drama color grading, no dialogue, just aura vibe music, vertical 9:16, 8 seconds, ultra realistic, preserve face 100%.\n\nImage Prompt: Create a cinematic Korean drama classroom scene, reference face same 100%, boy with curly hair wearing red and navy blue hoodie sitting at wooden desk, notebook on desk, soft smile, attitude look, green classroom walls. Use the uploaded reference image to preserve the person''s identity and facial features; do not change the face.\n\nReference video: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xPZ2rj5JPMUV4lLt1JWW3DqfM8POm4z7')
